ported from Taimen-KitKat (DoomGuy41); /proc/version has a clang-built kernel: accept any compiler in parentheses (About phone showed Unknown)

diff --git a/src/com/android/settings/DeviceInfoSettings.java b/src/com/android/settings/DeviceInfoSettings.java
